|---|---|---|
| schema dict | ExecutionContext.global_schema | \_session_store["schema"] (copied from EC) |
| target override | ExecutionContext.global_target / user_overrides | \_session_store["target_override"] |
| model selection | ExecutionContext.model_choices | \_session_store["model_selection"] |
| training signals | ExecutionContext.training_signals | — |
| lazy data refs | \_session_store["datasets"] | — (not in EC) |
| scaler path | \_session_store["scaler_path"] | — (not in EC) |

